#: ../installation/index.rst:16
msgid "Installation manual"
msgstr "Priručnik za instalaciju"

#: ../installation/index.rst:18
msgid "Galette installation is quite simple, really :) Just a few graphical steps to follow once the prerequisites are met."
msgstr ""
"Instalacija Galettea jednostavna je :) Nakon ispunjavanja preduvjeta slijedi "
"tek nekoliko koraka u grafičkom sučelju."

#: ../installation/index.rst:20
msgid "First, download latest Galette release from official repository:"
msgstr ""
"Najprije preuzmite najnovije izdanje Galettea iz službenog repozitorija:"

#: ../installation/index.rst:22
msgid "Get latest Galette!"
msgstr "Preuzmite najnoviji Galette!"

#: ../installation/index.rst:26
msgid "Then, uncompress the archive. If you are running Windows, you will have to install a file archiver software supporting the TAR archive format, such as `7zip <https://www.7-zip.org/>`_. If you are using Linux, run the following commands (adapt the version if needed):"
msgstr ""
"Zatim raspakirajte arhivu. U sustavu Windows instalirajte program koji "
"podržava TAR arhive, primjerice `7zip <https://www.7-zip.org/>`_. U sustavu "
"Linux pokrenite sljedeće naredbe (po potrebi prilagodite verziju):"

#: ../installation/index.rst:35
msgid "The current stable version of Galette is |stable_version|. A `nightly archive <https://galette.eu/download/galette-dev.tar.bz2>`_ is build each night from the development branch, and you can also :doc:`retrieve Galette development version  <../source_code>`."
msgstr ""
"Trenutna stabilna verzija Galettea je |stable_version|. Svake se noći iz "
"razvojne grane izrađuje `noćna arhiva <https://galette.eu/download/galette-"
"dev.tar.bz2>`_, a možete i :doc:`preuzeti razvojnu verziju Galettea <../"
"source_code>`."

#: ../installation/index.rst:37
msgid "Galette is also available as a Docker image and as a YunoHost application, see :doc:`other installation methods <other_methods>`."
msgstr ""
"Galette je dostupan i kao Docker slika te kao YunoHost aplikacija. "
"Pogledajte :doc:`ostale načine instalacije <other_methods>`."
